#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
